 "releases": [
  {
   "id": "kona-ii-brume-211242@post-2023-11-24",
   "gameId": "kona-ii-brume-211242",
   "displayName": "Patch Notes 2023-11-24",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "inferred",
   "announcedAt": "2023-11-24T16:24:55.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hi all,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "A new update is now live, focusing on offering more performance scaling options as well as ways to make the game more enjoyable on smaller screens such as the Steam Deck and other portable devices.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "New Settings",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "We made these improvements and additions to the game settings:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Made automatic settings for new players based on hardware infos",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Separated Display and Graphics settings",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added DLSS setting for Nvidia cards*",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "new",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Added render scale setting to customize FidelityFX scaling",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added anti-aliasing quality setting",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added ui + text scale settings",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added texture quality setting",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "*Please note that there is no way at the moment to specify a DLSS mode (Quality vs Performant). It will appear in the next update scheduled in early December. Note that when DLSS is active, antialiasing and render scales have no effect. We also had to remove some post processing effects such as radial blur and warp and ghost when DLSS is active, because they do not scale well.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "new",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Quality of Life Improvements",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "In response to some of the suggestions we found in the forum, we implemented the following quality of life improvements:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added health kit and herbs count in the inventory",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added item counts in the quick inventory",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Allowed exiting Map and Inventory using their opening shortcuts",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Changed the pause sfx to make it less annoying for repeated usage",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Other Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Light and water quality optimizations",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Teleport if you fall trough the map during boss fight",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed Floating Debris and Crossword narrations not playing in narration-less mode",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed various minor textures and visual bugs",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "And that's it :) As always, if you run into any issue, please head to the forums, we are always there and happy to help!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Cheers,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Alex",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
